OL,3,GNEWSAWhat would new regional mayors
OL,4,Amean for the South?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for two new regional mayors have
OL,7,Fmoved a step closer after they were
OL,8,Fnamed in the Budget.
OL,10,FThe government said it was in the
OL,11,F"final stages" of agreeing mayoral
OL,12,Fauthorities for Wessex and the Thames
OL,13,FValley, as part of 10 new devolution
OL,14,Fdeals across England.
OL,16,FSupporters say a mayor would bring more
OL,17,Fmoney and control over transport,
OL,18,Fhousing and skills, with decisions made
OL,19,Flocally rather than in Westminster.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
