OL,3,GNEWSAWhat would new regional mayors
OL,4,Amean for the South?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some council leaders and MPs have
OL,7,Fquestioned the areas being covered and
OL,8,Fwhether the benefits will outweigh the
OL,9,Fcosts.
